e this","url":"stremio:///detail/series/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Xb21hbi1pbi10aGUtV2FsbC0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8"}],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.1.1","title":"The Unheavenly Host","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"1994-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mrs Drusse, a hypochondriac psychic gets herself admitted to the Kingdom because she believes the hospital is haunted. Meanwhile, Dr Helmer, a Dane-hating Swede under investigation for malpractice joins the hospital's secret brethren.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4J7THwoIq0Gxm2pyP4Bn82KtkLE.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.1.2","title":"Thy Kingdom Come","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"1994-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mrs Drusse continues her investigation, Krogshøj steals the severed head from Mogge and uses it to blackmail him, while Bondo is at his wits' end when a patient's relative refuses to hand over his liver infected with a rare cancer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m5JrmkHeSU4BowmxEiSoHaupU8o.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.1.3","title":"A Foreign Body","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"1994-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dr Helmer decides to steal the incriminating report but unbeknownst to him, Krogshøj has the same plan, Bondo wants to transplant the cancerous liver into himself, and Mrs Drusse finds out Mary didn't die of TB as reported.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l6SGRpxBWMUAFXF8RKGBc8281Va.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.1.4","title":"The Living Dead","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"1994-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Helmer goes to Haiti which angers his gun-wielding girlfriend, Judith may be pregnant with a ghost, Mrs Drusse reburies Mary's remains but her troubles are only just beginning, and Operation Morning Breeze turns into a farcical disaster.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cykFF6gXmr0R4V1ICk0dmmqcWyd.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.2.1","title":"Death on the Operating Table","season":2,"episode":1,"released":"1997-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After Moesgaard's tour of the hospital, the director orders the Secret Brotherhood to investigate the hospital's problems. A sudden accident sends Drusse, who had been reluctantly discharged, back to the surgical ward. Despite her difficult delivery, Judith prepares to meet her baby.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sgC6fyH6HwKGwEK9xu97Kw8RVut.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.2.2","title":"Birds of Passage","season":2,"episode":2,"released":"1997-11-08T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After poisoning Krogshøj, Dr. Helmer fears another investigation will be launched and goes to help him. While recovering from her surgery, Mrs. Drusse attends a gathering with the restless spirits, but not everyone is welcome there. Judith's son continues to grow at an alarming rate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5CM4XC3TTVMwMp5hj4DdrGlwFBE.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUtpbmdkb20tJTI4UmlnZXQlMjktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMTk5NCUyOS8.2.3","title":"Gargantua","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"1997-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dr. Krogshøj's life hangs in the balance. Moesgaard manages to avert conflict in the ward, but the Kingdom remains in danger of falling apart. After coming face to face with the embodiment of Satan, Mrs. Drusse must rely on Bulder's knowledge of the Kingdom's deepest recesses.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/62YfxQAfX2Cd5F106DI5dC3bSRu.jpg"}]}}